   "n": 11,
   "html": "Mesmo denominador: some ou subtraia.<div class=\"grid\"><div><span class=\"fr\"><span>3</span><span>8</span></span> + <span class=\"fr\"><span>2</span><span>8</span></span> = <input class=\"in\" data-a=\"5/8\" data-t=\"f\" style=\"width:64px\"  placeholder=\"_/_\" autocomplete=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\"></div><div><span class=\"fr\"><span>7</span><span>9</span></span> − <span class=\"fr\"><span>4</span><span>9</span></span> = <input class=\"in\" data-a=\"3/9|1/3\" data-t=\"f\" style=\"width:64px\"  placeholder=\"_/_\" autocomplete=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\"></div></div>",
   "gab": "5/8 · 3/9 = 1/3"
  },
  {
   "n": 12,
   "html": "Denominadores diferentes: encontre frações equivalentes e calcule.<div class=\"grid\"><div><span class=\"fr\"><span>1</span><span>2</span></span> + <span class=\"fr\"><span>1</span><span>4</span></span> = <input class=\"in\" data-a=\"3/4|6/8\" data-t=\"f\" style=\"width:64px\"  placeholder=\"_/_\" autocomplete=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\"></div><div><span class=\"fr\"><span>2</span><span>3</span></span> − <span class=\"fr\"><span>1</span><span>6</span></span> = <input class=\"in\" data-a=\"3/6|9/18|1/2\" data-t=\"f\" style=\"width:64px\"  placeholder=\"_/_\" autocomplete=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\"></div></div>",
   "gab": "3/4 · 1/2"
  },
  {
   "n": 13,
   "html": "João comeu <span class=\"fr\"><span>2</span><span>8</span></span> da torta e Maria comeu <span class=\"fr\"><span>3</span><span>8</span></span>.<div class=\"row\"><div class=\"cc\"><svg class=\"ill\" width=\"110\" height=\"110\" viewBox=\"0 0 110 110\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><g transform=\"translate(55,55)\"><path d=\"M0 0 L0.00 -48.00 A48 48 0 0 1 33.94 -33.94 Z\" fill=\"#F07E26\" stroke=\"#2b2b3a\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><path d=\"M0 0 L33.94 -33.94 A48 48 0 0 1 48.00 0.00 Z\" fill=\"#F07E26\" stroke=\"#2b2b3a\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><path d=\"M0 0 L48.00 0.00 A48 48 0 0 1 33.94 33.94 Z\" fill=\"#3D6FD1\" stroke=\"#2b2b3a\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><path d=\"M0 0 L33.94 33.94 A48 48 0 0 1 0.00 48.00 Z\" fill=\"#3D6FD1\" stroke=\"#2b2b3a\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><path d=\"M0 0 L0.00 48.00 A48 48 0 0 1 -33.94 33.94 Z\" fill=\"#3D6FD1\" stroke=\"#2b2b3a\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><path d=\"M0 0 L-33.94 33.94 A48 48 0 0 1 -48.00 0.00 Z\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#2b2b3a\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><path d=\"M0 0 L-48.00 0.00 A48 48 0 0 1 -33.94 -33.94 Z\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#2b2b3a\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><path d=\"M0 0 L-33.94 -33.94 A48 48 0 0 1 -0.00 -48.00 Z\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#2b2b3a\" stroke-width=\"2\"/></g></svg><div class=\"small\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;width:12px;height:12px;border-radius:3px;background:#F07E26;border:1px solid #2b2b3a;vertical-align:-1px\"></span> João &nbsp; <span style=\"display:inline-block;width:12px;height:12px;border-radius:3px;background:#3D6FD1;border:1px solid #2b2b3a;vertical-align:-1px\"></span> Maria</div></div><div class=\"ql\"><div>a) Que fração eles comeram juntos? <input class=\"in\" data-a=\"5/8\" data-t=\"f\" style=\"width:64px\"  placeholder=\"_/_\" autocomplete=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\"></div><div>b) Que fração da torta sobrou? <input class=\"in\" data-a=\"3/8\" data-t=\"f\" style=\"width:64px\"  placeholder=\"_/_\" autocomplete=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\"></div></div></div>",
   "gab": "a) 5/8 · b) 3/8"
  },
  {
   "n": 14,
   "html": "Multiplique a fração pelo número natural:<div class=\"grid\"><div>3 × <span class=\"fr\"><span>2</span><span>7</span></span> = <input class=\"in\" data-a=\"6/7\" data-t=\"f\" style=\"width:64px\"  placeholder=\"_/_\" autocomplete=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\"></div><div>4 × <span class=\"fr\"><span>1</span><span>5</span></span> = <input class=\"in\" data-a=\"4/5\" data-t=\"f\" style=\"width:64px\"  placeholder=\"_/_\" autocomplete=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\"></div><div>2 × <span class=\"fr\"><span>3</span><span>10</span></span> = <input class=\"in\" data-a=\"6/10|3/5\" data-t=\"f\" style=\"width:64px\"  placeholder=\"_/_\" autocomplete=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\"></div></div>",
   "gab": "6/7 · 4/5 · 6/10 = 3/5"
